  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 100 × 121 + 11 - 7 ÷ 24 - 8 × 33 × 99 ÷ 17 = ?\n\nAfter interchanging '+' with '÷', and '-' with '×':\n\n⇒ 100 - 121 ÷ 11 × 7 + 24 × 8 - 33 - 99 + 17 = ?\n\n⇒ 100 - __**121 ÷ 11**__ × 7 + 24 × 8 - 33 - 99 + 17 = ?\n\n⇒ 100 - __**11 × 7**__ + __**24 × 8**__ - 33 - 99 + 17 = ?\n\n⇒ 100 - __**77**__ + __**192**__ - 33 - 99 + 17 = ?\n\n⇒ __**23**__ + 192 - 33 - 99 + 17 = **100** \n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
